### Create Inventory Stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productVariantId": 999,
  "locationCode": "TEST-WH01",
  "quantityOnHand": 50,
  "reorderLevel": 10
}

### Get Created Stock
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/stock/1ee4aab9-5481-491e-a983-543a1ecd9c66

### Get All Stock
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/stock